# Production environment variable names (no secrets)

```
APP_ENV=production
SERVER_PORT=8080
DATABASE_URL=
DATABASE_USER=
DATABASE_PASSWORD=
REDIS_URL=
JWT_ACCESS_SECRET=
JWT_ACCESS_TTL_SECONDS=900
JWT_REFRESH_TTL_SECONDS=2592000
S3_ENDPOINT=
S3_BUCKET=
S3_ACCESS_KEY=
S3_SECRET_KEY=
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=
```

All values supplied by secret manager / GitHub Environment. Never commit real values.
